        "Title": "Exterminate the Exterminator",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHAMERICA",
        "PublicId": "122960610095",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 53c1bee8-289a-498b-8b09-1167a981fd5c).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Your target today is Jose Alvarez. An exterminator who may have a heart but does clearly doesn&apos;t care about his job. When exterminating bugs, Alvarez does not kill them, he knocks them out, captures them and then sets them free. Our client/his employer, Bug Swat, is fed up with his philosophy and wants you to kill him before one of his &quot;exterminations&quot; goes wrong and a home gets reinfested with bugs after he previously exterminated it. The clock is ticking 47, Good Luck.",
